# Claude Code's login hosts: the OAuth flow and the token refresh (the login's access token expires
# and the CLI renews it at these hosts, not at the model API). They stay reachable directly in every
# shape, the gateway shape with gateway.model true included: ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL moves the model calls
# to the gateway's anthropic subdomain, and the refresh does not follow that variable (verified
# 2026-10-13: the first start with model true blocked them, and the token would have expired at
# 22:06 with no way to renew). Telemetry hosts are deliberately absent.
claude.ai             # OAuth login flow
platform.claude.com   # OAuth login flow / console; the token refresh
console.anthropic.com # OAuth login flow / console
